  "description": "Yumeka, who suffered from severe insomnia.\nOne day, a 'fragrance' offered by a stranger changes her destiny.\n\nThat night, lighting the fragrance in desperation, Yumeka, drawn into sleep, finds herself stepping into `Monghwanru` (Dreamland Pavilion), a brothel where demons sell nights at the boundary of dream and reality…\n\nThere, she encounters Yato. His somehow familiar face and an irresistible, strange touch.\n\nEven knowing it's a dream, Yumeka helplessly surrenders herself to his temptation, spending sweet yet dangerous nights…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/6156000001), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14235535)     \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/6156000021), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14254345) \n\n**Official Translations:**   \nR19: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/183787)    \nR15: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/183786)",
